---
functor: 1
title: Named symbols
---

set heading(numbering: none)

Write a symbol by its name, with spaces between names: `x in A`. Each name is short and canonical. There are no aliases in files.

# Large operators

| Name | Result | Unicode |
|:--|:-:|:--|
| `sum` | $sum$ | U+2211, limits below and above in display |
| `prod` | $prod$ | U+220F, limits below and above in display |
| `coprod` | $coprod$ | U+2210, limits below and above in display |
| `integral` | $integral$ | U+222B |
| `union` | $union$ | U+22C3, limits below and above in display |
| `inter` | $inter$ | U+22C2, limits below and above in display |

